  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Silkie_Guinea_Pig?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2f/Silkie_Guinea_Pig.png/revision/latest?cb=20211130222828\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Silkie Guinea Pig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Silkie Guinea Pig\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Silkie Guinea Pig</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 71</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Needs </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Carrot</span><span title=\"Carrot(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Carrot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Carrot\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c3/Carrot.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20240218151353\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every 6 h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 40</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Blue voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>75 <span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Purple voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>10 <span>Voucher</span><span title=\"Golden voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span>5</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3150</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Silkie Guinea Pig</b> are pet <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a>.\n</p><p>\nThey give players <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points in exchange for <a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Carrot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">carrots</a>.</p><div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AFilePath%2FGuinea%20Pig%20House.png\" title=\"Guinea Pig House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guinea Pig House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Guinea Pig House</figcaption></figure><p>Each guinea pig costs 75 blue, 10 purple, and 5 gold <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a>, or 3150 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. They must be placed near a <a href=\"/wiki/guinea-pig-house-35051\" title=\"Guinea Pig House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">guinea pig house</a> to be bought. Players can have two silky guinea pigs.\nSilkie guinea pigs and guinea pig house can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shop</a>. <span>Shop</span><span title=\"Shop\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></p><div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Feeding</b></span></h3><p>\nWhen given <a href=\"/wiki/carrot-2081\" title=\"Carrot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">carrots</a> guinea pigs eat then roam around their house for 6 hours and finally fall asleep. Players can immediately wake them up to receive 40 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> per animal.</p><div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Waking guinea pigs one by one instead of all at once can increase your chance of getting a random <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-supplies-14729\" title=\"Category:Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supply item</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-pets-17088\" title=\"Category:Pets\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pets</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/agami-heron-35866\" title=\"Agami Heron\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Agami Heron\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/american-flamingo-36078\" title=\"American Flamingo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"American Flamingo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/anatolian-donkey-10430\" title=\"Anatolian Donkey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Anatolian Donkey\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andalusian-donkey-11356\" title=\"Andalusian Donkey\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andalusian Donkey\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andalusian-horse-2698\" title=\"Andalusian Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andalusian Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/andean-flamingo-36051\" title=\"Andean Flamingo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Andean Flamingo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/appaloosa-horse-35301\" title=\"Appaloosa Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Appaloosa Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"118\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/australian-pelican-35824\" title=\"Australian Pelican\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Australian Pelican\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bay-horse-2586\" title=\"Bay Horse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bay Horse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/black-bunny-27437\" title=\"Black Bunny\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bl