  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Silkie Guinea Pig.png|200px|left|Silkie Guinea Pig]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Animals|Animal]]\n |level = 71\n |needs = {{Infoicon|carrot|big|link=Carrot}}\n |time = every 6 h\n |cost= {{Infoicon|bluev|link=Voucher}}75 {{Infoicon|purplev|link=Voucher}}10 {{Infoicon|goldv|link=Voucher}}5\n |xp = 40\n |dia = 3150\n}}\n'''Silkie Guinea Pig''' are pet [[animals]].\n\nThey give players [[experience]] points in exchange for [[carrot]]s.{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Buying'''===\n[[File:Guinea Pig House.png|150px|left|Guinea Pig House|link=Special:FilePath/Guinea_Pig_House.png]]Each guinea pig costs 75 blue, 10 purple, and 5 gold [[voucher]]s, or 3150 [[diamond]]s. They must be placed near a [[Guinea Pig House|guinea pig house]] to be bought. Players can have two silky guinea pigs.\n\nSilkie guinea pigs and guinea pig house can be bought from the [[Shop]]. {{Infoicon|shop|bigger|link=Shop}}{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Feeding'''===\nWhen given [[carrot]]s guinea pigs eat then roam around their house for 6 hours and finally fall asleep. Players can immediately wake them up to receive 40 {{Infoicon|xp}} per animal.{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n\n*Waking guinea pigs one by one instead of all at once can increase your chance of getting a random [[:Category:Supplies|supply item]].\n\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Silkie-Meerschweinchen\n|es = Cobaya silkie\n|fr = Cochon d'Inde Sheltie\n|no = Silkie-marsvin\n}}\n[[ru:Морская свинка шелти]]\n\n[[Category:Guinea Pigs]]",
  "wikitextHash": "a934c822ec2e4133f0624e7eb7de164f8318b38a2fac78c27dbf87cdc9ce9d6a"
}
